1750..1827 Comment "/// The sum commutes (cubical\'s `+Comm`), by induction on the second summand,"
1828..1902 Comment "/// each step the recursive call carried along `up` or `down` and then the"
1903..1980 Comment "/// summand brought out of the left. The arms compose to no conversion of the"
1981..2055 Comment "/// answer at `x`, yet `Int` is a set, so its rules are respected by their"
2056..2083 Comment "/// endpoints alone (#427)."
